    "description": "1999 年 SNK 推出的彩色掌上游戏机，以 clicky 摇杆状十字键与格斗游戏阵容著称，是 SNK 破产前的最后一代掌机。",
    "intro": {
      "zh": "Neo Geo Pocket Color 是 SNK 于 1999 年推出的彩色掌上游戏机，是 Neo Geo Pocket 黑白初代的彩色升级版。它以独特的 clicky 摇杆状十字键著称——这颗可八方向微动按压、带清脆段落反馈的摇杆状十字键，为掌机格斗游戏带来了接近街机摇杆的精确出招手感。它延续了 SNK 的格斗基因，将《拳皇》《侍魂》等招牌格斗游戏便携化，是 SNK 破产前的最后一代掌机，也是掌机史上格斗游戏便携化的代表作。",
      "en": "The Neo Geo Pocket Color is a color handheld console released by SNK in 1999, the color upgrade of the monochrome Neo Geo Pocket. It is renowned for its clicky joystick-style D-pad — an eight-way microswitch stick with crisp tactile feedback that delivers near-arcade precision for portable fighting games. Continuing SNK's fighting-game DNA, it brought signature titles such as The King of Fighters and Samurai Shodown to the handheld, and was SNK's last handheld before its bankruptcy — a landmark of portable fighting games."
    },
    "category": "handheld",
    "era": 1999,
    "manufacturer": "SNK",
